# A release archive carries the package plus the few files a reader needs; the
# rest of the development tree stays in the repository. setuptools adds an
# untracked setup.cfg stub and an egg-info SOURCES.txt of its own to every sdist
# and cannot be talked out of it, so those two are expected here.
prune tests
prune .pytest_cache
prune __pycache__
prune *.egg-info
global-exclude *.py[cod]
